  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN223.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">piriviṭai vēṟupaṭṭa talaimakaḷait tōḻi vaṟpuṟuttiyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">How the confidante consoled HER who had undergone changes in the time of separation.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN223.1">
        <l>pirital valliya ratunat tuṟantōr</l>
        <l><anchor n="1"/>maṟantu mamaikuvar kolleṉ ṟeṇṇi</l>
        <l>yāḻal vāḻi tōḻi kēḻal</l>
        <l>vaḷaimarup puṟaḻu muḷaineṭum poṅkar</l>
        <l>naṉaimutir murukkiṉ ciṉaicēr peruṅkaṟ</l>
        <l>kāyciṉak kaṭu<supplied>vaḷi</supplied> yeṭuttaliṉ veṅkāṭ</l>
        <l>ṭaḻalpōḻ yāṉaiyi ṉaiyeṉat tōṉṟu</l>
        <l>niḻali lōmai nīri ṉīḷiṭai</l>
        <l>yiṟantaṉa rāyiṉuṅ kātalar namvayiṉ<anchor n="2"/></l>
        <l>maṟantukaṇ paṭutal yāvatu puṟantā</l>
        <l>ḻampaṇai neṭuntōṭ ṭaṅkit tumpi</l>
        <l>yariyiṉaṅ kaṭukkuñ curivaṇa raimpā</l>
        <l>ṉuṇṭuka ḷaṭaṅka vārip paiyuḷkeṭa</l>
        <l>naṉmukai yatiraṟ pōtoṭu kuvaḷait</l>
        <l>taṇṇaṟuṅ kamaḻtoṭar <anchor n="3"/>vēyntaniṉ</l>
        <l>maṇṇār kūntaṉ marīi<supplied>ya</supplied> tuyilē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">“He who has the harshness to part [from us], who abandoned us for that,</l>
        <l corresp="2">even though he forgot, will he be content?”, thinking so</l>
        <l corresp="3a-c">don’t be downcast, oh friend.</l>
        <l corresp="9ab">Even though he has gone to traverse</l>
        <l corresp="8">the waterless long road of shadeless spurges,</l>
        <l corresp="5">where the big stone joined by the branches of the Palas tree on which buds mature</l>
        <l corresp="3d-4">on sprouting long twigs that resemble curved boar’s tusks,</l>
        <l corresp="6">because the fierce wind lifts [them] in burning anger, in the hot wilderness,</l>
        <l corresp="7">appears wonderfully like an elephant crossing a fire,</l>
        <l rend="indent6">for [our] lover, forgetting</l>
        <l corresp="9c-10c">about us , what [kind of] sleeping will there be,</l>
        <l corresp="16">– [after] the sleep  [he had] when close to your earthy/well-washed tresses</l>
        <l corresp="15">that were covered with a cool, scented, fragrant chain</l>
        <l corresp="14">of waterlilies together with opening buds of well-budding  wild jasmine</l>
        <l corresp="13">so that [all] sorrow is lost, after combing [them out], so that fine dust settled,</l>
        <l>from the five-fold [hairstyle]  curved in curls that resemble a swarm of bees,</l>
        <l corresp="10d-12">staying on [your] pretty long bamboo schoulders, hanging down on [your] back.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

